    "label": "text",
    "text": "AN INTERIM DIVIDEND of TWO DOLLARS per share for the six months ending 30th June, 1925, will be payable on THURSDAY, August 6th, on which date Dividend Warrants may be obtained on application at the Company's Office, 11, Queen's Road Central."
  },
  {
    "label": "text",
    "text": "THE TRANSFER BOOKS of the Company will be CLOSED from THURSDAY, the 23rd JULY to WEDNESDAY, the 5th AUGUST (both days inclusive), during which period no transfer of shares can be registered."
